sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant F as React Frontend
    participant S as Spring Security Filter Chain
    participant A as AuthController / AuthService
    participant D as MySQL

    Note over U,D: Registration / Login
    U->>F: Submit register or login form
    F->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/register | /login
    A->>D: existsByEmail / loadUserByUsername
    alt Register (duplicate email)
        A-->>F: 409 RESOURCE_CONFLICT
    else Login (bad credentials)
        A-->>F: 401 UNAUTHORIZED "Invalid email or password"
    else Success
        A->>A: BCrypt hash (register) or AuthenticationManager authenticate
        A->>A: JwtTokenProvider.generateToken (sub, email, role, exp 24h)
        A-->>F: 200/201 {token, tokenType: Bearer, user}
        F->>F: localStorage lms_auth_token + lms_auth_user
    end

    Note over U,D: Authenticated request
    U->>F: Open protected route or API action
    F->>S: GET/POST /api/v1/... with Authorization Bearer
    S->>S: JwtAuthenticationFilter - validateToken, loadUserById
    S->>S: SecurityContext + @PreAuthorize role check
    alt Valid token + authorized role
        S->>D: Controller - Service - Repository
        D-->>S: entity
        S-->>F: 200 ApiResponse {success, message, data}
    else Missing / invalid token
        S-->>F: 401 UNAUTHORIZED JSON (JwtAuthenticationEntryPoint)
    else Wrong role
        S-->>F: 403 FORBIDDEN
    end
